1
00:00:00,772 --> 00:00:02,302
PENNY:
So,

2
00:00:02,307 --> 00:00:05,007
(Penny:)Dan, you have a grandson.
How old is he?

3
00:00:05,009 --> 00:00:06,309
(Dan:)Seven.
BERNADETTE:
Oh, yeah.

4
00:00:06,311 --> 00:00:08,181
(Bernadette:)I remember him from the picnic.

5
00:00:09,314 --> 00:00:12,144
(Bernadette:)He was the one crying
like a wuss the whole time.

6
00:00:13,184 --> 00:00:16,524
(Penny:)I heard he was being picked on
by a mean kid.

7
00:00:16,521 --> 00:00:18,121
(Bernadette:)Just builds character.

8
00:00:18,122 --> 00:00:20,122
(Bernadette:)Like my dad said,
"Nobody likes a crybaby

9
00:00:20,124 --> 00:00:22,424
(Bernadette:)except their mommies
and Democrats."

10
00:00:23,428 --> 00:00:24,728
(Dan:)I need another drink.

11
00:00:26,664 --> 00:00:28,594
(Bernadette:)What's his problem?
Oh.

12
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,600
(Raj:)I don't know.
Maybe he didn't like the fact

13
00:00:30,602 --> 00:00:32,432
(Penny:)that you called his grandson
a wuss.

14
00:00:32,437 --> 00:00:35,537
(Bernadette:)Well, I didn't think you were
supposed to say "sissy" anymore.

15
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:38,980
(Penny:)Okay, look, I know
what a good person you are,

16
00:00:38,977 --> 00:00:42,517
(Penny:)but sometimes people think you
might come off a little harsh.

17
00:00:42,514 --> 00:00:43,644
(Bernadette:)What?

18
00:00:43,648 --> 00:00:45,918
(Bernadette:)I'm, like, the sweetest person
I know.

19
00:00:47,151 --> 00:00:51,191
(Bernadette:)Look at me. I should be
in a tree baking cookies.

20
00:00:51,189 --> 00:00:53,189
(Penny:)Yes, but once in a while,

21
00:00:53,191 --> 00:00:56,561
(Penny:)people think
you're a little mean.

22
00:00:56,561 --> 00:00:57,561
(Dan:)Oh, yeah?

